      394.76,
      226.91
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SRI LANKA CULTURAL FOUNDATION",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      205.77,
      228.65,
      357.93,
      239.99
    ],
    "text": "FOR THE BUILDING OF CULTURE AND MORALS",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      254.57,
      401.88,
      330.95
    ],
    "text": "WHEREAS a Foundation called and known as \u201cSri LankaCultural Foundation for the building of Culture and Morals\u201dhas been established for the purpose of effectually carryingout and transacting all objects and matters connectedwith the said Foundation according to the rules agreedto by its members:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      345.65,
      401.9,
      408.95
    ],
    "text": "AND WHEREAS the said Foundation has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be for the public advantage togrant the said application:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      423.53,
      401.95,
      447.95
    ],
    "text": "BE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      462.53,
      401.87,
      499.91
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka CulturalFoundation for the Building of Culture and Morals(Incorporation) Act, No. of 2013.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      514.61,
      401.89,
      669.47
    ],
    "text": "2.From and after the date of commencement ofthis Act, such and so many persons as now presently aremembers of the \u201cSri Lanka Cultural Foundation for theBuilding of Culture and Morals\u201d (hereinafter referred to asthe \u201cFoundation\u201d) or shall hereafter be admitted as membersof the Corporatio hereby constituted, shall be a bodycorporate (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) withperpetual succession, under the name and style of the\u201cSri Lanka Cultural Foundation for the Building of Cultureand Morals\u201d and by that name may sue and be sued in allcourts with full power and authority to have and use acommon seal and alter the same at its pleasure.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      515.11,
      455.86,
      600.98
    ],
    "text": "Incorporationof theSri LankaCulturalFoundationfor theBuilding ofCulture andMorals.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
