  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.15,
      214.73,
      397.17,
      237.83
    ],
    "text": "3.The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      249.89,
      397.18,
      296.27
    ],
    "text": "(a)to resolve and encourage member unions for thepromulgation of relief services functions, and toprevent the poverty stricken situations from whichmen suffer;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      308.33,
      397.19,
      354.83
    ],
    "text": "(b)to form and foster a union for cultural services inevery country and to provide for incentives andpromotion and to establish the policies of the mainorganization within this union;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      366.89,
      397.19,
      401.63
    ],
    "text": "(c)to create and assist the projects for pre-disasterpreparation, at the national, regional andinternational level;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      413.69,
      397.18,
      448.43
    ],
    "text": "(d)to establish and utilize the required resources forsocial services, cultural restoration activities andpersonality development;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      173.71,
      460.49,
      397.18,
      495.23
    ],
    "text": "(e)to treat all nationals with equality, respecting theircultures, protecting all wayward artists andproviding relief work to them, as much as possible;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      175.15,
      507.29,
      397.22,
      553.67
    ],
    "text": "(f)to organize with close cooperation of the nationalunions and member unions in accordance with thecommon aims of the Corporation as well ascoordinating and operating;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      565.73,
      397.17,
      600.47
    ],
    "text": "(g)to provide an efficient organizational frameworkand information distribution infrastructure facilitiesat the national and regional level;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      172.87,
      612.53,
      397.2,
      670.91
    ],
    "text": "(h)to present certificates of skills esteemed certificatesof incentives, esteemed incentives, honorary consolawards, training artists and conducting programmes,creating the required background for them and itscontinuous maintenance;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
