    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      485.69,
      401.88,
      509.39
    ],
    "text": "(n)to legislate, promote and popularize people friendlylaws when ever required; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      522.65,
      401.9,
      558.59
    ],
    "text": "(o)to do all such other acts and things as are necessary,conducive or incidental to the attainment of theobjects of the Corporation.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Roman",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      573.77,
      401.89,
      671.15
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) The affairs of the Corporation shall subject to theother provisions of this Act and the rules in force for the timebeing of the Corporation, be administered by a SuperiorCommittee consisting of the Chairman / Director General,Administrative Secretary, Senior Vice Chairman, ViceChairman, Regional Organizer and Deputy Director Generalto be elected in accordance with such rules in force for thetime being of the Corporation.",
